# Remnawave Host values: Direct Reality

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| Remark | `Direct Reality` |
| Address | `${ORIGIN_IP}` or a direct DNS record pointing to it |
| Port | `443` |
| Config Profile | `${CONFIG_PROFILE_NAME}` |
| Inbound | `${REALITY_INBOUND_TAG}` |
| Network | `xhttp` |
| Security Layer | `Reality` |
| SNI | `${REALITY_PRIMARY_SERVER_NAME}` |
| Host | empty |
| Path | `${REALITY_XHTTP_PATH}` |
| Mode | `auto` |
| Fingerprint | `chrome` |
| Password / Public key (legacy UI) | `${REALITY_PASSWORD}` |
| Short ID | `${REALITY_PRIMARY_SHORT_ID}` |
| Allow insecure | `OFF` |

The public address must reach the origin directly. Do not use the TurboFlare edge
address for this Host. Although the client uses port 443, Xray listens only on
`${REALITY_LISTEN_IP}:${REALITY_PORT}` behind the Nginx SNI router.
